# Brute Force Attack Detection Lab

## Scenario

Multiple failed login attempts were detected on a Windows host `Finance-PC`.  
The activity suggests repeated authentication failures against a user account, potentially indicating a brute force attack.

This lab simulates detection and analysis of brute force login attempts using Windows Security logs in Splunk.

